    already stated.  The edit box gets the same panel through a "Tools" button: the wrong-tools moment is usually
    the resend.
    The dot is redrawn by renderChat and renderMcp, so it follows the chat you switch to and any change you make.
    Tests: serve/test_chat_sidebar.js case 93 drives it by clicks - no dot before a list exists, no dot when the
