    REVISED from the human's read of it (2026-11-19, same day): the button is titled "MCP Servers"; the "Tools for
    X" heading is gone; the server's NAME is itself a switch that takes the whole server out of this conversation
    (or brings back what the settings offer now, not what used to be there); the chips are the Monitor's chips
