    (every click needs `panel = s94.s.chatMenu` again), and the cost text moved inside the footer, so a top-level
    text join stopped seeing it - the helper now walks the subtree.
    A bug the tests caught here: renderMcp called chatToolsFor(), which CREATES the list - so merely drawing the
